{"id":"wb-1-31","name":"鲁迅墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"鲁迅墓","text":"鲁迅墓是文学家鲁迅的墓地，位于中国上海市虹口区欧阳路街道鲁迅公园西北角，占地1,600平方米，建成于1956年，同年鲁迅的遗体由万国公墓迁葬入该墓。\n1961年3月4日，中华人民共和国国务院公布鲁迅墓为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。1964年7月，鲁迅墓的具体范围最终划定。它由上海鲁迅纪念馆维护。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%B2%81%E8%BF%85%E5%A2%93","revisionId":95276558,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95276558","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e750862cd7887e4111f52be3.jpg","title":"鲁迅先生之墓.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%B2%81%E8%BF%85%E5%85%88%E7%94%9F%E4%B9%8B%E5%A2%93.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6f/%E9%B2%81%E8%BF%85%E5%85%88%E7%94%9F%E4%B9%8B%E5%A2%93.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Ioseph Franciscus","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​\"鲁迅先生之墓\"题字及墓穴","width":320,"height":213}}